+# Password Hashing
+
+The project's current recorded decision is that passwords are hashed with bcrypt. This was recorded on 2026-09-25 as a security note (observation #4, "Passwords hashed with bcrypt") and has not been superseded or revised by any later recorded decision. No work factor (cost) or other parameters are recorded.
